### Read public trip data
GET http://localhost:3000/api/trips

### Login (replace the placeholders with your local admin credentials)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.invalid",
  "password": "REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_ADMIN_PASSWORD"
}

### Admin-only trip creation (paste the token from the login response)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_VALID_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "code": "TEST1",
  "name": "Test Trip",
  "length": "2 nights / 3 days",
  "start": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "resort": "Test Resort",
  "perPerson": "$499",
  "image": "test.jpg",
  "description": "Test trip"
}
